@startuml Sequence Create Record
!theme plain

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Medical Service" as Medical
database "Medical DB" as DB

User -> Frontend: Заполняет форму создания записи
Frontend -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/medical/records\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\n{title, description, record_date, ...}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: JWT middleware: валидация токена
Gateway -> Gateway: Извлечение user_id из claims
Gateway -> Gateway: Добавление user_id в контекст
Gateway -> Medical: POST /api/v1/medical/records
activate Medical
Medical -> Medical: Извлечение user_id из контекста
Medical -> Medical: Валидация данных
Medical -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_records\n(user_id, title, description, ...)
activate DB
DB --> Medical: Созданная запись (с ID)
deactivate DB
Medical --> Gateway: 201 Created\n{record}
deactivate Medical
Gateway --> Frontend: 201 Created\n{record}
deactivate Gateway
Frontend -> Frontend: Обновление списка записей
Frontend --> User: Отображение новой записи

@enduml

